{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746710/extras/57a5eb3dd898a8a8831f4669d72e78f6.avif?t=1762357165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746710/extras_big/57a5eb3dd898a8a8831f4669d72e78f6.webp?t=1762357165 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a vampire cat trying to run a barbershop\u2026 without biting the costumers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wash, cut, shave chat and fight your thirst. One haircut at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746710/extras/0d63f488797c532b6a2631ba63357c01.avif?t=1762357165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746710/extras_big/0d63f488797c532b6a2631ba63357c01.webp?t=1762357165 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut hair and trim beards with precision and quick reflexes. As your bloodlust increases, your controls get reversed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wash hair while dealing with a few tricky inverted arrows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each task gets harder the thirstier you become. And you thought pretty doesn\u2019t hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746710/extras/d9149bddb13db1c11e0b0756454d1626.avif?t=1762357165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746710/extras_big/d9149bddb13db1c11e0b0756454d1626.webp?t=1762357165 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad cuts or bloody accidents will hurt your reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your performance influences the story, unlocking different endings. Some hilarious, others unsettling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Messed up? Clean up the evidence quickly or risk raising suspicion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore a single stain, and it might cost your credibility (or your costumer).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characteristics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique bloodlust mechanic that affects the game\u2019s difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames that get harder each day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eccentric and atmospheric soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters full of dark humor</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"CATastrophic Demise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746710/67512f92bf9d9d9b9f64bc2d40ff973d4c7c6065.jpg"},{"name":"A Meowssacre","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746710/8dc893a56d91e5ad7ac1ed136378bb7d871b3ed1.jpg"},{"name":"Ameowzing Clawntrol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746710/cf43da8d517adb0aebdc966182cd6f06c3ef5d1c.jpg"},{"name":"Special Diet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746710/8de50fc2d694f23a0f6270dadf43834a6a3c60f1.jpg"},{"name":"New Year, New Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746710/9e8b38da6bdf0b0cec3f1343ad3041b4d70c4de7.jpg"},{"name":"Not Just a Phase","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746710/16e2ca74262cac865738e6018e188c88576fe29c.jpg"},{"name":"This Better Be a Joke...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746710/62d1ecfc3dda54560b1dc04830006b1f59f9575f.j